<!-- Làm câu hỏi (spec mục 6): một thẻ câu hỏi, đáp án là RadioButton hay CheckBox (ô nhập với câu điền), nút Kiểm tra;
     sai thì báo và làm lại, đúng thì hiện lời giải (như QuestionCard.svelte). Thanh tiến độ, câu trước, câu sau.
     Ghi chú, cờ nghi sai, mở slide ở cuối thẻ câu hỏi (dùng được cả trước khi làm đúng). Nội dung vẽ bằng ContentRenderer. -->
<UserControl xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:l="clr-namespace:BKStudyDesk.Desktop.Lang"
             x:Class="BKStudyDesk.Desktop.Views.Practice.QuizRunView">
    <!-- Cột đọc tối đa ReadingMaxWidth, sát lề trái như các trang khác. -->
    <Grid><Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="*" MaxWidth="{StaticResource ReadingMaxWidth}" /></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
    <StackPanel Spacing="24">
        <DockPanel>
            <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8" VerticalAlignment="Top">
                <Button x:Name="NewRoundButton" Content="{l:T practice.run.newRound}" IsVisible="False" Click="OnNewRound" />
                <Button x:Name="CopyAllButton" IsVisible="False" Click="OnCopyAll" />
                <Button Content="{l:T practice.back}" Click="OnBack" />
            </StackPanel>
            <StackPanel Spacing="2">
                <TextBlock x:Name="TitleText" Classes="title" />
                <TextBlock x:Name="MetaText" Classes="meta" />
            </StackPanel>
        </DockPanel>
        <StackPanel x:Name="ShufflePanel" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="16" IsVisible="False">
            <CheckBox x:Name="ShuffleQuestions" Content="{l:T practice.run.shuffleQuestions}" IsCheckedChanged="OnShuffle" />
            <CheckBox x:Name="ShuffleOptions" Content="{l:T practice.run.shuffleOptions}" IsCheckedChanged="OnShuffle" />
        </StackPanel>
        <TextBlock x:Name="HintText" Classes="meta" IsVisible="False" />
        <ProgressBar x:Name="Bar" Minimum="0" />

        <Border x:Name="EmptyCard" Classes="card" IsVisible="False">
            <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyText" Classes="empty" />
        </Border>

        <Border x:Name="QuestionCard" Classes="card">
            <StackPanel>
                <Border Classes="card-head"><DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" x:Name="TagText" Classes="meta" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                    <TextBlock x:Name="NumberText" Classes="card-title" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                </DockPanel></Border>
                <StackPanel Margin="16" Spacing="16">
                    <StackPanel Spacing="2">
                        <TextBlock x:Name="WhereText" Classes="sub" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="StatusText" Classes="sub" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                    </StackPanel>
                    <ContentControl x:Name="Prompt" />
                    <StackPanel x:Name="Options" Spacing="8" />
                    <StackPanel x:Name="AnswerRow" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8" IsVisible="False">
                        <TextBox x:Name="AnswerBox" Width="320" KeyDown="OnAnswerKey" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="UnitText" Classes="sub" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                        <Button x:Name="CheckButton" Classes="accent" Content="{l:T practice.run.check}" Click="OnCheck" />
                        <Button x:Name="PrevButton" Content="{l:T practice.run.prev}" Click="OnPrev" />
                        <Button x:Name="NextButton" Content="{l:T practice.run.next}" Click="OnNext" />
                    </StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="RetryText" Classes="danger" TextWrapping="Wrap" IsVisible="False" />
                    <StackPanel Spacing="8">
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="16">
                            <Button x:Name="SlideButton" Click="OnSlide" />
                            <CheckBox x:Name="FlagBox" Content="{l:T practice.run.flag}" IsCheckedChanged="OnFlag" />
                            <Button x:Name="CopyOneButton" Content="{l:T practice.report.copyOne}" IsVisible="False" Click="OnCopyOne" />
                        </StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock x:Name="SlideMissing" Classes="sub danger" IsVisible="False" />
                        <TextBox x:Name="NoteBox" PlaceholderText="{l:T practice.run.note}" AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap" MinHeight="64" LostFocus="OnNoteLost" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
            </StackPanel>
        </Border>

        <Border x:Name="SolutionCard" Classes="card" IsVisible="False">
            <StackPanel>
                <Border Classes="card-head"><TextBlock x:Name="Verdict" Classes="verdict ok" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="{l:T practice.run.right}" /></Border>
                <StackPanel Margin="16" Spacing="12">
                    <TextBlock x:Name="AnswerText" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                    <TextBlock x:Name="ReorderedText" Classes="sub" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="{l:T practice.run.reordered}" />
                    <ContentControl x:Name="Solution" />
                </StackPanel>
            </StackPanel>
        </Border>
    </StackPanel>
</Grid>
</UserControl>
